": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031392_381033337811787_5701494533830343396_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6CK2sxHuIZ0Q7kNvwFrdvRG&_nc_oc=Adp4mIGZRentZxNM96jmeKsqKiuhk-SsyAujMFJCJIvRK6KR7bSXyA_hern3qTNjQT8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEScf-_0-zT-9mIOv1tiv1nzcdvAetHDAWDjU2B7C29Jw&oe=6A8D674B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "24.png", "id": "479792944623870", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031358_479792947957203_7701327199303146140_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mMfOaNe3l3EQ7kNvwEGwAFa&_nc_oc=AdpQCnh5zx3BBsfIg5n5pBzY5iyNZFm4R8tjaeXjzYotJ13-HijlXwM1LE0grK8zQNI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHzPm9kSVh6k5tylgM-yqM3E3OgrbdcNMp2pLxXLAPICA&oe=6A8D70EC"}, "display_name": "Gracia", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Gracia is a platform that redefines virtual reality, offering free-viewpoint ultra-photorealistic VR experiences. It's not just about seeing; it's about stepping inside a photo with freedom to walk around, where every detail is so vivid, you'll forget it's virtual.\n\nKey features:\n\n- Unmatched Photorealism: Gracia\u2019s advanced rendering technology blurs the line between virtual and reality and creates a feeling as if you are inside high-resolution photograph. \n- 6DOF Volumetric Scenes: Move and interact within our scenes with complete freedom as if you were really there.\n- Extremely High Fidelity: Up to 550 fps at native resolution.\n- Ever Expanding Store of Scenes: Regular updates keep the content fresh and exciting.", "short_description": "Gracia is a world's first platform with free-viewpoint ultra-photorealistic VR experiences. It's not just about seeing; it's about stepping inside a photo with freedom to walk around, where every detail is so vivid, you'll forget it's virtual."}]}, "developer_name": "Gracia", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://